{"id": "B-000001", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "paragraph", "heading_path": ["Introduction"], "lines": [2, 2], "text": "Query ArXiv is a tool designed to streamline the process of fetching research papers from the ArXiv database. It allows users to perform advanced searches based on parameters like category, author, title, and abstract, with an added feature to filter results based on recent publication dates.", "text_hash": "sha256:5da7e3ddad0eccb4db416bc8fe858f2f8a9edb71edb5cc4b58c5a3869decc73b", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:5da7e3ddad0eccb4db416bc8fe858f2f8a9edb71edb5cc4b58c5a3869decc73b"}
{"id": "B-000002", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "paragraph", "heading_path": ["Goals"], "lines": [5, 5], "text": "The main goal is to create an efficient, user-friendly tool for querying the ArXiv database, enhancing the research process by offering flexible and time-sensitive search capabilities. It should also allow user to either print query results to console or save them to specified csv file.", "text_hash": "sha256:25e533560ea002a3d315b60463aa458c8a46056efb711a8dde8e1892aeee84e2", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:25e533560ea002a3d315b60463aa458c8a46056efb711a8dde8e1892aeee84e2"}
{"id": "B-000003", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [8, 8], "text": "- Advanced Query Options:", "text_hash": "sha256:a7b9bf309d2b573ec16e16f3def0d32b843622864d8eebd65a1b85278e964115", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:a7b9bf309d2b573ec16e16f3def0d32b843622864d8eebd65a1b85278e964115"}
{"id": "B-000004", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [9, 9], "text": "    - Enables querying by any combinations of `category`, `author`, `title`, and `abstract`. But at least one of them should be specified", "text_hash": "sha256:7cb4845cd3e4bc3c0c17c76c13a4615c824af65ccbc748f8b00d51134b0c2a34", "parent_block": "B-000003", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:7cb4845cd3e4bc3c0c17c76c13a4615c824af65ccbc748f8b00d51134b0c2a34"}
{"id": "B-000005", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [10, 10], "text": "    - `max_results` parameter to control the number of results, with a sensible default (recommanded: 10).", "text_hash": "sha256:a9dca9d94ff73147e3d1e792a5da15a8acd45b12a8d93c6954d8a8f3b709ea43", "parent_block": "B-000003", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:a9dca9d94ff73147e3d1e792a5da15a8acd45b12a8d93c6954d8a8f3b709ea43"}
{"id": "B-000006", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [11, 11], "text": "- Time-based Filtering:", "text_hash": "sha256:e32f6ca718b69760e576d59dba78209d591738215f6d54b1e47214ba0612cf3a", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:e32f6ca718b69760e576d59dba78209d591738215f6d54b1e47214ba0612cf3a"}
{"id": "B-000007", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [12, 12], "text": "    - Integrates a mandatory `recent_days` parameter, not directly supported by ArXiv. This feature requires custom implementation:", "text_hash": "sha256:95d03269412907b01cd1c66db332d38f1b0c5821ad765875c14ac164415348d9", "parent_block": "B-000006", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:95d03269412907b01cd1c66db332d38f1b0c5821ad765875c14ac164415348d9"}
{"id": "B-000008", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [13, 13], "text": "        - **Query URL Construction:** Queries are structured with sortBy=submittedDate and sortOrder=descending to fetch recent papers first.", "text_hash": "sha256:b67bc9b92a8fa9e0b203b5d879a8d05e9931eceb40f56a81ac2b96a3450b1d77", "parent_block": "B-000007", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:b67bc9b92a8fa9e0b203b5d879a8d05e9931eceb40f56a81ac2b96a3450b1d77"}
{"id": "B-000009", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [14, 14], "text": "        - **Example Query URL:**", "text_hash": "sha256:0eb83dfde6b8b925f877827d8a9aa619a859b4a4efc6da4e4c09311886418484", "parent_block": "B-000007", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:0eb83dfde6b8b925f877827d8a9aa619a859b4a4efc6da4e4c09311886418484"}
{"id": "B-000010", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "code", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [15, 17], "text": "        ```\n        http://export.arxiv.org/api/query?search_query=cat:cs.CL+AND+au:Smith+AND+ti:neural+AND+abs:learning&sortBy=submittedDate&sortOrder=descending&start=0&max_results=10\n        ```", "text_hash": "sha256:50f18a3478a88d93852798750450f9b95087ffb085c7624173cba6fcb7a8ccdb", "parent_block": "B-000007", "parent_relation": "continuation", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": null}
{"id": "B-000011", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [18, 18], "text": "        - **Custom Date Check:** The `check_date` function is written to filter the results based on the recent_days parameter, ensuring only papers from the specified recent period are included.", "text_hash": "sha256:0f2c0edfe19eee33e6d04d0245916e125c19f8bcdab3acac8b3d7e57f2da2163", "parent_block": "B-000007", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:0f2c0edfe19eee33e6d04d0245916e125c19f8bcdab3acac8b3d7e57f2da2163"}
{"id": "B-000012", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [20, 20], "text": "- Output Handling:", "text_hash": "sha256:c3fb388b917171b14cd822914073f263e3c9066131620eab74386cce90679f6a", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:c3fb388b917171b14cd822914073f263e3c9066131620eab74386cce90679f6a"}
{"id": "B-000013", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [21, 21], "text": "    - Console Output for immediate viewing, controlled by --verbose.", "text_hash": "sha256:e420fee81f33bfdccaebdfa3cb4077b5e540e63c5fba437bb7e5bf94067c2130", "parent_block": "B-000012", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:e420fee81f33bfdccaebdfa3cb4077b5e540e63c5fba437bb7e5bf94067c2130"}
{"id": "B-000014", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [22, 22], "text": "    - CSV Export option controlled by --to_file.", "text_hash": "sha256:1ea881944993dfecb66f76c9e393dea7fcab964e3ef52dc1fbfbf0920fd43bc4", "parent_block": "B-000012", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:1ea881944993dfecb66f76c9e393dea7fcab964e3ef52dc1fbfbf0920fd43bc4"}
{"id": "B-000015", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [23, 23], "text": "    - If both specified, print to console and save to csv; else if only --to_file, only save to csv; otherwise (either only --verbose or neither specified), print to console", "text_hash": "sha256:91877eef00a3813299c4fa56899e2de2bc9ed8f450a5841f8db0210053f4a49f", "parent_block": "B-000012", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:91877eef00a3813299c4fa56899e2de2bc9ed8f450a5841f8db0210053f4a49f"}
{"id": "B-000016", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [25, 25], "text": "- User Input Processing:", "text_hash": "sha256:a2ef1cba02514d534e771bd17df375e70fd8b0b9c1cbd6ea3087dd01f7be3334", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:a2ef1cba02514d534e771bd17df375e70fd8b0b9c1cbd6ea3087dd01f7be3334"}
{"id": "B-000017", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [26, 26], "text": "    - Command-line arguments for search parameters and output preferences.", "text_hash": "sha256:16eb688a41ddc8f8135e07bd6f2895c0e3d315ec6831f9d2c8b0f8ee0a62efd5", "parent_block": "B-000016", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:16eb688a41ddc8f8135e07bd6f2895c0e3d315ec6831f9d2c8b0f8ee0a62efd5"}
{"id": "B-000018", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [27, 27], "text": "- Data Retrieval and Processing:", "text_hash": "sha256:253f73c68fcf1cc0d56663845ac57d972de4334e3d224a03420da78950edc98b", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:253f73c68fcf1cc0d56663845ac57d972de4334e3d224a03420da78950edc98b"}
{"id": "B-000019", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [28, 28], "text": "    - Efficient API interactions and XML data parsing according to user criteria.", "text_hash": "sha256:93b89815cfa61c7f30461c15015cac8462749c1af2ef3595ce6955fe8f5b53c1", "parent_block": "B-000018", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:93b89815cfa61c7f30461c15015cac8462749c1af2ef3595ce6955fe8f5b53c1"}
{"id": "B-000020", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [29, 29], "text": "- Result Filtering and Formatting:", "text_hash": "sha256:e1e0ccb1ae6f3677568213aafa8c5c76182ab587bb3dfcea16a72fe02f2ac86e", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:e1e0ccb1ae6f3677568213aafa8c5c76182ab587bb3dfcea16a72fe02f2ac86e"}
{"id": "B-000021", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [30, 30], "text": "    - Applies date filtering via check_date.", "text_hash": "sha256:e81fd7e9d180341884670a7fc475e49d306fba1ce2311d9368dee7c0625ca98d", "parent_block": "B-000020", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:e81fd7e9d180341884670a7fc475e49d306fba1ce2311d9368dee7c0625ca98d"}
{"id": "B-000022", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [31, 31], "text": "    - Coherent presentation of key details in both console and CSV.", "text_hash": "sha256:e6e4ead88598776e66695cd04a9b51c35b5fc7845e3b76c4405e793991718553", "parent_block": "B-000020", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:e6e4ead88598776e66695cd04a9b51c35b5fc7845e3b76c4405e793991718553"}
{"id": "B-000023", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [32, 32], "text": "        - Both console output and CSV columns should include at least the following inforamtion:", "text_hash": "sha256:a8d7ba4157d155c916795920f20291e836fba4f08c0f070efa0fc89c0d62a1f8", "parent_block": "B-000022", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:a8d7ba4157d155c916795920f20291e836fba4f08c0f070efa0fc89c0d62a1f8"}
{"id": "B-000024", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [33, 33], "text": "            - `category`", "text_hash": "sha256:1e8934654e3e6015f45b248848c9cf5cd22dc8dd1e3363f25dddae7298869dfb", "parent_block": "B-000023", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:1e8934654e3e6015f45b248848c9cf5cd22dc8dd1e3363f25dddae7298869dfb"}
{"id": "B-000025", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [34, 34], "text": "            - `title`", "text_hash": "sha256:a2dad45be773839bf329aaa00cc8b5155e3423af2487d2408b6a0a9ae44ceae1", "parent_block": "B-000023", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:a2dad45be773839bf329aaa00cc8b5155e3423af2487d2408b6a0a9ae44ceae1"}
{"id": "B-000026", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [35, 35], "text": "            - `author`", "text_hash": "sha256:6b63b5bcb664088e4d06faa3d1c8294b342f25c18c0869f2e09de6df5f04a1b0", "parent_block": "B-000023", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:6b63b5bcb664088e4d06faa3d1c8294b342f25c18c0869f2e09de6df5f04a1b0"}
{"id": "B-000027", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [36, 36], "text": "            - `abstract`", "text_hash": "sha256:2a5958a9f2c902215e053066eca76c76aa5ad29a0fddcea1a2a0f1ee7806bc46", "parent_block": "B-000023", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:2a5958a9f2c902215e053066eca76c76aa5ad29a0fddcea1a2a0f1ee7806bc46"}
{"id": "B-000028", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [37, 37], "text": "            - `published`: publication date", "text_hash": "sha256:fa28481b223c16caec946fee30d2c77fe54f9516eca7f67124cb6e48c57e5e5f", "parent_block": "B-000023", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:fa28481b223c16caec946fee30d2c77fe54f9516eca7f67124cb6e48c57e5e5f"}
{"id": "B-000029", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Features and Functionalities"], "lines": [38, 38], "text": "            - `link`", "text_hash": "sha256:b18d9599e7ea184f7cd7454c659e8f029610a69aa0a7b3b739c617eb299ed137", "parent_block": "B-000023", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:b18d9599e7ea184f7cd7454c659e8f029610a69aa0a7b3b739c617eb299ed137"}
{"id": "B-000030", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Technical Constraints"], "lines": [42, 42], "text": "- The tool will be developed in Python, utilizing necessary libraries for API interaction, XML data parsing, and command-line argument parsing.", "text_hash": "sha256:2d31b2c83d9e6eef31fb5455c4c7d787375a60ddb472364874a2b0a85cac3d8f", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:2d31b2c83d9e6eef31fb5455c4c7d787375a60ddb472364874a2b0a85cac3d8f"}
{"id": "B-000031", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Technical Constraints"], "lines": [43, 43], "text": "- Compliance with ArXiv API usage guidelines and rate limits is required.", "text_hash": "sha256:e95c7e03f6aeac7d6bf6a4166c9bf5001e0ddb7ec829319cf2e8812e5b0d2ddf", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:e95c7e03f6aeac7d6bf6a4166c9bf5001e0ddb7ec829319cf2e8812e5b0d2ddf"}
{"id": "B-000032", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Technical Constraints"], "lines": [44, 44], "text": "- Accurate and reliable date handling for time-based filtering.", "text_hash": "sha256:3ea2be4381aa42bb7b6e09f5f10d0eb97ccce2d47bc00055048954ff5729340c", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:3ea2be4381aa42bb7b6e09f5f10d0eb97ccce2d47bc00055048954ff5729340c"}
