{"id": "B-000036", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "paragraph", "heading_path": ["Requirements", "Usage"], "lines": [53, 53], "text": "To execute a query, run the following script:", "text_hash": "sha256:7f5c675841753664cfc71e16c54d5ec4c5bf652911e9bceafdc27631503963ca", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:7f5c675841753664cfc71e16c54d5ec4c5bf652911e9bceafdc27631503963ca"}
{"id": "B-000037", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "code", "heading_path": ["Requirements", "Usage"], "lines": [55, 64], "text": "```bash\npython query_arxiv.py \n--category [category] \n--title [title] \n--author [author] \n--abstract [abstract]\n--recent_days [number_of_days]\n[--to_file path_to_csv_file]\n[--verbose]\n```", "text_hash": "sha256:e16998fad667887db566e4cfd1fb3e7b81e1ebe69e870c27d18946fb9d842004", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:e16998fad667887db566e4cfd1fb3e7b81e1ebe69e870c27d18946fb9d842004"}
{"id": "B-000038", "source": "sdd/specs/PRD.md", "kind": "paragraph", "heading_path": ["Requirements", "Usage"], "lines": [66, 66], "text": "At least one of the query parameters `[category, title, author, abstract]` must be provided, along with the mandatory `--recent_days` parameter. All arguments should be constructed with only characters from `\"ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz0123456789+:.\"`; otherwise, a `ValueError` will be raised.", "text_hash": "sha256:0c82860efc1a7e9fe7b55fb75365a7e0b0e1871d4c07fdda41057d95a58eeda6", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:0c82860efc1a7e9fe7b55fb75365a7e0b0e1871d4c07fdda41057d95a58eeda6"}
