{"id": "B-000052", "source": "sdd/specs/UML_class.md", "kind": "paragraph", "heading_path": ["UML class"], "lines": [2, 2], "text": "`Global_functions` is a fake class to host global functions", "text_hash": "sha256:c9262c8174ab7b69f7d499b559f23bf38639743c63447af1ab33fff7a013232a", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:c9262c8174ab7b69f7d499b559f23bf38639743c63447af1ab33fff7a013232a"}
{"id": "B-000053", "source": "sdd/specs/UML_class.md", "kind": "code", "heading_path": ["UML class"], "lines": [3, 14], "text": "```\nclassDiagram\n    class Global_functions{\n        +get_args(argv=None) -> argparse.Namespace\n        +construct_query_url(category: str = None,title:str = None, author: str = None, abstract: str = None, max_results: int = 10) -> str\n        +fetch_data(query_url: str) -> bytes\n        +process_entries(entries: List[ET.Element], namespace: Dict[str, str], current_date: datetime, recent_days: int) -> List[Dict[str, str]]\n        +check_date(date_string: str, recent_days: int, current_date: datetime) -> bool\n        +save_to_csv(papers: List[Dict[str, str]], file_name: str) -> None\n        +print_results(papers: List[Dict[str, str]]) -> None\n    }\n```", "text_hash": "sha256:404ddb07af97bad7720e55aa22262d500d4bb2f31066fcfe0f9bd85dfb1fead9", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": null}
{"id": "B-000054", "source": "sdd/specs/UML_class.md", "kind": "code", "heading_path": ["UML class"], "lines": [16, 27], "text": "```mermaid\nclassDiagram\n    class Global_functions{\n        +get_args(argv=None) -> argparse.Namespace\n        +construct_query_url(category: str = None,title:str = None, author: str = None, abstract: str = None, max_results: int = 10) -> str\n        +fetch_data(query_url: str) -> bytes\n        +process_entries(entries: List[ET.Element], namespace: Dict[str, str], current_date: datetime, recent_days: int) -> List[Dict[str, str]]\n        +check_date(date_string: str, recent_days: int, current_date: datetime) -> bool\n        +save_to_csv(papers: List[Dict[str, str]], file_name: str) -> None\n        +print_results(papers: List[Dict[str, str]]) -> None\n    }\n```", "text_hash": "sha256:da40faf8838635725ad37819fb78c825e74de601b0f0d7df683508097539f81c", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:da40faf8838635725ad37819fb78c825e74de601b0f0d7df683508097539f81c"}
{"id": "B-000055", "source": "sdd/specs/UML_sequence.md", "kind": "paragraph", "heading_path": ["UML sequence"], "lines": [2, 2], "text": "`Global_functions` is a fake class to host global functions", "text_hash": "sha256:c9262c8174ab7b69f7d499b559f23bf38639743c63447af1ab33fff7a013232a", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:c9262c8174ab7b69f7d499b559f23bf38639743c63447af1ab33fff7a013232a"}
{"id": "B-000056", "source": "sdd/specs/UML_sequence.md", "kind": "code", "heading_path": ["UML sequence"], "lines": [3, 20], "text": "```\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant Global_functions\n    participant main\n    main->>Global_functions: get_args()\n    Global_functions->>main:args\n    main->>Global_functions: construct_query_url()\n    Global_functions->>main: query_url\n    main->>Global_functions: fetch_data()\n    Global_functions->>main: data\n    main->>Global_functions: process_entries()\n    Global_functions->>Global_functions: check_date()\n    Global_functions->>main: papers\n    main->>Global_functions: save_to_csv()\n    Global_functions->>main: csv file\n    main->>Global_functions: print_results()\n    Global_functions->>main: console output\n```", "text_hash": "sha256:233201499c2baca55924658cf289eb747574f7a6bf8e5769774524d5b072c121", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": null}
{"id": "B-000057", "source": "sdd/specs/UML_sequence.md", "kind": "code", "heading_path": ["UML sequence"], "lines": [22, 39], "text": "```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant Global_functions\n    participant main\n    main->>Global_functions: get_args()\n    Global_functions->>main:args\n    main->>Global_functions: construct_query_url()\n    Global_functions->>main: query_url\n    main->>Global_functions: fetch_data()\n    Global_functions->>main: data\n    main->>Global_functions: process_entries()\n    Global_functions->>Global_functions: check_date()\n    Global_functions->>main: papers\n    main->>Global_functions: save_to_csv()\n    Global_functions->>main: csv file\n    main->>Global_functions: print_results()\n    Global_functions->>main: console output\n```", "text_hash": "sha256:5af2ba03f8609d06d9aad085dfc058d99012f70983b26974eb698dd138087578", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:5af2ba03f8609d06d9aad085dfc058d99012f70983b26974eb698dd138087578"}
