{"id": "B-000064", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [21, 21], "text": "- To make a complete query request, run `sh ./examples/run_query_all.sh`. An example of the script `run_query_all.sh` is shown as follows.", "text_hash": "sha256:45fc7942dcf5b14412396186174b7280bd3037e365e996f1e5c3565da01827df", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:45fc7942dcf5b14412396186174b7280bd3037e365e996f1e5c3565da01827df"}
{"id": "B-000065", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "code", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [22, 32], "text": "```\npython query_arxiv.py \\\n--category cs.CL \\\n--title LLM \\\n--author Smith \\\n--abstract Deep+Learning \\\n--recent_days 10 \\\n--to_file output/query_all_results.csv \\\n--verbose \\\n>> output/query_all_results.txt\n```", "text_hash": "sha256:f93af6ccf317c258c634d3eed98f9eff243e98d5f9d362bbbd378e2440c3e698", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": null}
{"id": "B-000066", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [34, 34], "text": "- To make a query request that only save results to csv while not print result to console, run `sh ./examples/run_query_only_csv.sh`. An example of the script `run_query_only_csv.sh` is shown as follows.", "text_hash": "sha256:15d380ee72ee198b5dd6e4ce69ae82bf7c227c3396e42b42e180398c7a257908", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:15d380ee72ee198b5dd6e4ce69ae82bf7c227c3396e42b42e180398c7a257908"}
{"id": "B-000067", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "code", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [35, 43], "text": "```\npython query_arxiv.py \\\n--category cs.CL \\\n--title LLM \\\n--author Smith \\\n--abstract Deep+Learning \\\n--recent_days 10 \\\n--to_file output/query_only_csv_results.csv\n```", "text_hash": "sha256:5f5911236090ce54384f6485776d157af554ae1d5c3a984230fefc418c120a74", "parent_block": null, "parent_relation": null, "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": null}
