{"id": "B-000073", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [59, 59], "text": "    - construct_query_url(): construct query url that is going to be send to ArXiv API according to arguments.", "text_hash": "sha256:abbbe3f2a2886c2c837606fb6bc08d791d1d7f56af4a272b23d1f5c237629457", "parent_block": "B-000072", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:abbbe3f2a2886c2c837606fb6bc08d791d1d7f56af4a272b23d1f5c237629457"}
{"id": "B-000074", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [60, 60], "text": "    - fetch_data(): get response from ArXiv API through a get request.", "text_hash": "sha256:d93fe1401f5e2437148c8b64328352789d73ceb0adcdb80fe8b77d7fa91c6373", "parent_block": "B-000072", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:d93fe1401f5e2437148c8b64328352789d73ceb0adcdb80fe8b77d7fa91c6373"}
{"id": "B-000075", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [61, 61], "text": "    - process_entries(): process response from ArXiv and return a list of dictionaries to store paper information", "text_hash": "sha256:b0aafbc1b3c4dc9d1b8d9e5fbcd8ef6530d41136917c5bf300655adfd65ce557", "parent_block": "B-000072", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:b0aafbc1b3c4dc9d1b8d9e5fbcd8ef6530d41136917c5bf300655adfd65ce557"}
{"id": "B-000076", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [62, 62], "text": "    - check_date(): check if the publication date of the a certain paper is within k days from current date (k specified by arguments)", "text_hash": "sha256:51151572ed951b5c1cb6f58b489f5fad0b2743e5d2e6665bd2e9490c34341981", "parent_block": "B-000072", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:51151572ed951b5c1cb6f58b489f5fad0b2743e5d2e6665bd2e9490c34341981"}
{"id": "B-000077", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [63, 63], "text": "    - save_to_csv(): save valid papers to csv file whose path/fileName is specified by arguments", "text_hash": "sha256:9964187ed854cfad3b9bcc540e0e0789914a3c9323c4db3c16c3b599a880168d", "parent_block": "B-000072", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:9964187ed854cfad3b9bcc540e0e0789914a3c9323c4db3c16c3b599a880168d"}
{"id": "B-000078", "source": "sdd/specs/architecture_design.md", "kind": "list_item", "heading_path": ["Architecture Design"], "lines": [64, 64], "text": "    - print_results(): print search results to console (abstract being truncated)", "text_hash": "sha256:1fc3d12c1223b1d009d3907bf7ebd7a0a49a1e02bf488a1e536bb942f0a004f8", "parent_block": "B-000072", "parent_relation": "nested", "table_header": null, "in_blockquote": false, "first_seen_run": "R-000001", "last_changed_run": "R-000001", "removed_run": null, "atomized_hash": "sha256:1fc3d12c1223b1d009d3907bf7ebd7a0a49a1e02bf488a1e536bb942f0a004f8"}
